{"id":"n67694-1-9","stage":4,"title":"연연하다 · 迷恋","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67694-1-9-1","ko":"유민이가 왜 시험에서 부정행위를 했을까?","zh":"裕敏为什么会在考试中作弊呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에서","meaning":"考验","explanation":"시험：考验；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"3","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에서","audio":"/audio/03bc4310d38533975076.mp3"}},{"text":"부정행위를","meaning":"舞弊行为，作弊","explanation":"부정행위：舞弊行为，作弊；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부정행위","audio":"/audio/4573d6fdd80742bdf6f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59818","senseId":"1","lemma":"부정행위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부정행위를","audio":"/audio/ddd1571feda4520f5e04.mp3"}},{"text":"했을까?","meaning":"做、进行（부정행위를 하다：作弊）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（부정행위를 하다：作弊）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했을까","audio":"/audio/ad99131c95aebe097a97.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考验","audio":"/au